    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Dividends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Benefits - Dividends</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250319}\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </>You can claim Club dividend rewards once a week.\nClub dividend rewards are affected by the Club's activity level and your personal activity in the current Club last week.\nClub dividend rewards will refresh every Monday at 8:00; please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃津贴]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Клубные дивиденды】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Доступ к системе: </><Assistant_System>Меню - Клуб - Преимущества - Дивиденды</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250319}\n<Assistant_Title2>Описание игрового процесса: </>Вы можете претендовать на клубные дивиденды раз в неделю. \nClub дивидендные вознаграждения зависят от уровня активности клуба и вашей личной активности в текущий клуб на прошлой неделе. Дивидендные вознаграждения \nClub будут обновляться каждый понедельник в 8:00; пожалуйста, получите свои награды вовремя.\n<Assistant_Title3>Рекомендуемые поисковые запросы: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity]|1403}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant Tenets and Exclusive Gameplay】</>\nEach Covenant has its own rules; please follow them and complete weekly quests, otherwise, you will be penalized.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Exclusive Gameplay:</>\nDifferent Covenants have different exclusive gameplay and abilities. Beyonders can try different Covenant gameplay by switching Covenants.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Принципы Ковенанта и эксклюзивный игровой процесс】</>\nКаждый Ковенант имеет свои собственные правила; пожалуйста, следуйте им и выполняйте еженедельные квесты, иначе вы будете наказаны.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Эксклюзивный игровой процесс:</>\nРазличные ковенанты имеют разные эксклюзивные игровые процессы и способности. Потустороннийs могут попробовать другой игровой процесс Ковенанта, переключая Ковенанты.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Рекомендуемые поисковые запросы:</>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}",
    ["<P_Heart> (Lowers voice) </> There used to be a primitive sacrificial tradition there, worshipping a so-called 'God of Weather'."] = "<P_Heart> (Пониже голос) </> Раньше там существовала примитивная жертвенная традиция поклонения так называемому «Богу погоды».",
    ["<Yellow>Full Moon Curse</>: When receiving damage from enemies within <Yellow>8</> meters, the Crimson Moon Crown is activated, reducing damage taken by the player by <Yellow>*f**</>. Maintains the Full Moon Curse on up to <Yellow>3</> non-boss targets within <Yellow>8</> meters that have attacked the player, reducing their damage dealt by <Yellow>*f**</>; the Crimson Moon Crown effect lasts for <Yellow>5</> seconds and can be activated at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Dark Spells</>: When dealing damage to enemy targets, gain the Corrosive Claws effect for <Yellow>5</> seconds: Damage increased by <Yellow>*f**</>, and enemy units that take damage have their movement speed reduced by <Yellow>*f**</> for <Yellow>4</> seconds (applies once per single target). This effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds."] = "<Yellow>Full Moon Curse</>: When receiving damage from enemies within <Yellow>8</> meters, the Crimson Moon Crown is activated, reducing damage taken by the player by <Yellow>*f**</>. Maintains the Full Moon Curse on up to <Yellow>3</> non-boss targets within <Yellow>8</> meters that have attacked the player, reducing their damage dealt by <Yellow>*f**</>; the Crimson Moon Crown effect lasts for <Yellow>5</> seconds and can be activated at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds. \n<Yellow>Dark Spells</>: When dealing damage to enemy targets, gain the Corrosive Claws effect for <Yellow>5</> seconds: Damage increased by <Yellow>*f**</>, and enemy units that take damage have their Скорость бега reduced by <Yellow>*f**</> for <Yellow>4</> seconds (applies once per single target). This effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time every <Yellow>10</> seconds.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛程安排</>\n<Highlight>首场四方联赛</>将在开服<Highlight>第一周周日中午12:00</>通过对俱乐部的综合评判划分赛区、分组，并于<Highlight>当日晚18:00</>公示赛区以及分组。联赛以<Highlight>每两场对阵为一轮</>，每一轮持续<Highlight>两周</>，开服第一周周日晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启首轮联赛（特殊），后续调整为每周六晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启四方联赛。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛制规则</>\n每轮比赛由两场对阵组成。每轮第一场开始前，本组第1、2名，第3、4名，第5、6名以及第7、8名将分别进入不同的比赛小组，并在满足该规则的前提下<Highlight>随机分配</>。第一场比赛结束后，各比赛小组<Highlight>前2名进入胜者组</>，后2名进入败者组。第二场比赛将分别进行胜者组与败者组对决，并根据比赛结果确定本轮<Highlight>第1至第8名</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>晋降级规则</>\n每轮第二场比赛结束后，将于当周周六21:00进行本轮晋降级：<Highlight>圣名组及圣名组以上</>分组内前两名晋级上一分组，末两名降级至下一分组；<Highlight>英杰组及英杰组以下</>组内第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组。其中<Highlight>传奇组、史诗组、旅者组</>为特殊分组：传奇组第一、二名晋升一组，第六、七名均降一组，第八名降两组；史诗组第一、二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组；旅者组第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七、八名降级两组；挑战者组第一名晋升两组，第二、三名晋升一组。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>联盟组规则</>\n排名在旅者组之后的俱乐部将根据<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>划分至<Highlight>挑战者组</>（前八名）及后续<Highlight>联盟组</>（<Highlight>联盟组不参与升降级</>）。联盟组的俱乐部将在每场联赛开始前<Highlight>自动匹配</>其它俱乐部组成联盟，以联盟形式参与四方联赛，联盟内<Highlight>所有俱乐部成员</>均可入场参战，联盟中<Highlight>排名最高俱乐部的会长</>将在局内自动获得<Highlight>联赛指挥权限</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛季重置</>\n每个新赛季开始时联赛将<Highlight>重新划分赛区</>，届时将按照<Highlight>上一赛季联赛成绩</>重新匹配对手构建新的赛区。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide divisions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs on <Highlight> the Sunday at 12:00 PM of the first week </> after the server opens, and the divisions and groups will be announced at <Highlight> 6:00 PM that same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) will start at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week, and subsequent Four-Way Leagues will be adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st/2nd, 3rd/4th, 5th/6th, and 7th/8th place teams in the group will be placed into different match groups and <Highlight> randomly assigned </>, provided this rule is met. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the Winners' Bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the Losers' Bracket. The second match will feature matchups within the Winners' and Losers' Brackets respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place on Saturday at 9:00 PM: <Highlight> For the Holy Name Group and above </>, the top two in the group promote to the higher group, and the bottom two relegate to the lower group; <Highlight> For the Hero Group and below </>, the first place in the group promotes two groups, the second place promotes one group, the seventh place relegates one group, and the eighth place relegates two groups. Among them, <Highlight> Legendary Group, Epic Group, and Traveler Group </> are special groups: Legendary Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 6th and 7th both relegate one group, 8th relegates two groups; Epic Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 7th relegates one group, 8th relegates two groups; Traveler Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd promotes one group, 7th and 8th relegate two groups; Challenger Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd and 3rd promote one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler Group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger Group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance Group </> (<Highlight> Alliance Group does not participate in promotion/relegation </>) based on <Highlight> total club Потусторонний rating </>. Before each league match, clubs in the Alliance Group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance and participate in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battlefield, and the <Highlight> President of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically receive <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide divisions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to construct new divisions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
